@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Plan: createPatch
+
+Single function in `src/index.ts`, no dependencies, reusing `jsonEqual`, `clone`, `isObject`, `hasOwn`.
+
+- Objects: remove / recurse / add per key.
+- Arrays: strip common prefix and suffix, LCS on deep equality, then per gap: pair items in order and recurse (when smaller than a replace), then remove or add the surplus. Gaps are processed last to first so earlier indices keep their original coordinates. A moved item is a `remove` plus an `add` (allowed by the request).
+- Mismatched types or primitives: `replace`.
+
+## Constitution Check
+- I: RFC 6902 §4/§5 and RFC 6901 §3 named; escaping implemented exactly.
+- II: no dependencies. III: tests first (`test/create-patch.test.ts`), round-trip with `applyPatch`.
+- IV: no mutation, output cloned, `__proto__` safe. V: typed, exported, documented. VI: one function plus helpers.
